---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="BitEvo — Agent Authority & Evidence Audit" description="Engineering audit of AI-agent authority, evidence, logging, traceability and operational controls.">
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="kicker">Agent Authority & Evidence Audit</div>
      <h1 class="display">Can your agent prove what it was allowed to do?</h1>
      <p class="copy">BitEvo reviews agent authority, action chains, evidence, logging, traceability and operational controls against an agreed staging/test workflow. Findings are bounded to reproducible evidence; this is not certification or a guarantee of safety.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/agent-authority-audit" class="button">See audit scope</a>
        <a href="/audit-intake" class="button secondary">Open audit intake</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">What the audit examines</h2>
      <div class="grid cols3">
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🧭</div><h3>Authority</h3><p>Which actions, tools and external systems the agent can invoke, where approval boundaries sit, and what happens when authority is ambiguous.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🧾</div><h3>Evidence</h3><p>Whether decisions and actions can be reconstructed from logs, inputs, approvals, outputs and source freshness without inventing missing provenance.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🛡️</div><h3>Failure controls</h3><p>Agreed failure scenarios, prohibited actions, replay boundaries, least-necessary data handling, and whether controls fail closed when evidence is insufficient.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof-section">
    <div class="container proof-card">
      <div class="kicker">Internal lab example · redacted</div>
      <h2>LAB-001 — “Healthy service, stale truth”</h2>
      <p>Services appeared healthy while the underlying source freshness had stopped advancing. Finding class: <strong>false-green observability</strong>.</p>
      <div class="labels"><span>INTERNAL_LAB_CASE_REDACTED</span><span>customer_case=false</span><span>independent_certification=false</span></div>
      <p class="small">No private IP addresses, hostnames, credentials, customer data or secret-bearing logs are exposed in this public example.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="offer-section">
    <div class="container offer-card">
      <div><div class="kicker">Primary commercial pilot</div><h2>$4,900 fixed · 5 working days</h2><p>1 staging/test workflow · up to 3 tools / APIs / MCP servers · 10–20 agreed failure scenarios · executive report · reproducible evidence pack · prioritized repair backlog · one retest.</p></div>
      <a href="/audit-intake" class="button">Start scope</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section{padding-block:70px 44px}.hero-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center}.kicker{color:var(--gold);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}.display{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 20px;max-width:900px}.copy{font-family:'Lora',serif;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 28px}.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 22px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(120,175,208,.2),rgba(63,86,96,.1));border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:var(--radius)}.button.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--muted)}.features-section,.proof-section,.offer-section{padding-block:34px}.section-title{text-align:center;font-size:.92rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:24px}.grid{display:grid;gap:20px}.cols3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.card,.proof-card,.offer-card{background:var(--paper-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px}.card-icon{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px}.card h3,.proof-card h2,.offer-card h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;margin:0 0 10px}.card p,.proof-card p,.offer-card p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;line-height:1.65}.proof-card{max-width:920px}.labels{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0}.labels span{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 9px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}.small{font-size:.82rem}.offer-card{max-width:980px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}.offer-card .button{white-space:nowrap}@media(max-width:820px){.cols3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.offer-card{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
</style>
